*** Keywords ***
Attempt To Change EnergySaving Parameter On Unsupported Radio
    [Documentation]  This methods tries to activate DEEPSLEEP on RMOD that doesn't support this feature.
    ...              Failure in config validation is expected.
    ...              ARGS:
    ...              - rmod_config_distname: configuration dist name of radio module.

    [Arguments]
    ...                                       ${rmod_config_distname}

    Check EnergySaving Parameter              rmod_config_distname=${rmod_config_distname}
    ...                                       expected_energy_saving=NORMAL
    ...                                       expected_power_state=UNAVAILABLE

    ${bts_type}=                              hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${connection}=                            connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                       bts_type=${bts_type}

    Robot Log Operation                       Attemtping to change EnergySaving parameter to DEEPSLEEP on ${rmod_config_distname}...
    Run Keyword And Expect Error              AdminApiProcedureFailureException:*it is required that radio must support deep sleep mode as energy saving mode*
    ...                                       config_operations.set parameter value
    ...                                       dist_name=${rmod_config_distname}
    ...                                       param_name=energySavingMode
    ...                                       param_value=DEEPSLEEP
    ...                                       skip_parameter_relation_errors=False

Check EnergySaving Parameter
    [Documentation]  This method checks if EnergySaving parameter is set to specified state on radio module.
    ...              ARGS:
    ...              - rmod_config_distname: configuration dist name of radio module.
    ...              - expected_energy_saving: value of expected energy saving parameter (DEEPSLEEP or NORMAL).
    ...              - expected_power_state: value of expected energy saving parameter (AWAKE, SLEEP or UNAVAILABLE).

    [Arguments]
    ...                                       ${rmod_config_distname}
    ...                                       ${expected_energy_saving}
    ...                                       ${expected_power_state}

    ${bts_type}=                              hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${connection}=                            connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                       bts_type=${bts_type}

    ${rmod_runtime_distname}=                 admin_info_model.translate_rmod_distname
    ...                                       rmod_distname=${rmod_config_distname}
    ...                                       output_distname_type=runtime
    ...                                       connection=${connection}

    Robot Log Operation                       Verifying RMOD EnergySaving parameters...
    ...                                       to_console=${False}

    config_operations.connect                 alias=${connection}
    ${energy_saving}=                         config_operations.get_parameter_value
    ...                                       dist_name=${rmod_config_distname}
    ...                                       param_name=energySavingMode
    ${power_state}=                           config_operations.get_parameter_value
    ...                                       dist_name=${rmod_runtime_distname}
    ...                                       param_name=powerState

    Should Be Equal As Strings                ${energy_saving}     ${expected_energy_saving}
    ...                                       msg=Energy saving parameter value is different than expected: ${energy_saving}!=${expected_energy_saving}
    Should Be Equal As Strings                ${power_state}       ${expected_power_state}
    ...                                       msg=Power state parameter value is different than expected: ${power_state}!=${expected_power_state}

    Robot Log Result                          RMOD EnergySaving parameters are in correct state!

Enable EnergySaving
    [Arguments]
    ...                                       ${rmod_config_distname}
    ...                                       ${energySaving_param_value}=DEEPSLEEP

    ${bts_type}=                              hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${connection}=                            connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                       bts_type=${bts_type}

    Robot Log Operation                       Enabling EnergySaving on ${rmod_config_distname}...

    config_operations.connect                 alias=${connection}
    config_operations.set_parameter_value     dist_name=${rmod_config_distname}
    ...                                       param_name=energySavingMode
    ...                                       param_value=${energySaving_param_value}

    Robot Log Result                          EnergySaving enabled!

Disable EnergySaving With Status Check
    [Arguments]
    ...                                       ${rmod_config_distname}

    ${bts_type}=                              hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${connection}=                            connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                       bts_type=${bts_type}
    ${rmod_id}=                               Evaluate   int(str("""${rmod_config_distname}""").split('-')[-1])

    Start Watching Cells Parameters On RMOD In Deep Sleep
    ...                                       rmod_config_distname=${rmod_config_distname}
    Disable EnergySaving                      rmod_config_distname=${rmod_config_distname}

    Robot Log Operation                       Waiting for RMOD-${rmod_id} online status...
    timer.wait_until_keyword_succeeds_timer   5min
    ...                                       10s
    ...                                       status_check.verify_statuses_of_rmod
    ...                                       connection=${connection}
    ...                                       status_variant=online
    ...                                       rmod_id=${rmod_id}

    Robot Log Result                          RMOD status validation finished successfully.

    timer.wait_until_keyword_succeeds_timer   6min
    ...                                       10s
    ...                                       Check EnergySaving Parameter
    ...                                       rmod_config_distname=${rmod_config_distname}
    ...                                       expected_energy_saving=NORMAL
    ...                                       expected_power_state=AWAKE

    Stop Watching Cells Parameters On RMOD In Deep Sleep

Disable EnergySaving
